                <pb facs="0697" n="687" sameAs="frus:frus1949v08/pg687"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.00/5–649: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Ambassador in France</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Caffery</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-05-10T19:00:00-04:00">May 10, 1949—7 p.
                            m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1517. Urtel 1842, May 6. Too early state at this time what steps US Govt will
                    take re diplomatic reps Canton shld Chi Govt again move capital. Decision will
                    be made at proper moment in light <hi rendition="#italic">inter alia</hi> of
                    location new capital. Dept keeping in touch with Fr Emb Washington re this and
                    other related matters.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Acheson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
